### 1. Fetch Invoices List for Company A (Protected)
GET http://localhost/api/invoices
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 2. Create a New Invoice for Company A (Protected)
POST http://localhost/api/invoices
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
    "invoice_number": "INV/2026/09/{{$random.alphanumeric(8)}}",
    "customer_name": "International Tech Solutions Ltd",
    "customer_tax_id": "EU987654321",
    "net_amount": 2500.00,
    "vat_amount": 575.00,
    "gross_amount": 3075.00,
    "due_date": "2026-10-15"
}

###

### 4. Login as Central Owner (Universal Context)
POST http://localhost/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost

{
    "email": "owner@saas.com",
    "password": "password"
}

> {%
    // Automatically capture the token from the response and store it globally
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 5. Login as Tenant Sub-Account Employee (Isolated Context)
POST http://localhost/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost

{
    "email": "employee@company.com",
    "password": "password"
}

> {%
    // Automatically capture the token from the response and store it globally
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 6. Logout User (Revoke Token)
POST http://localhost/api/logout
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

